Because your project uses ESM, add this file:

`database/migrations/package.json`

```json
{
  "type": "commonjs"
}
```

This allows Sequelize CLI migrations to use the traditional `module.exports` syntax. The CLI’s ESM support has historically required workarounds in projects using `"type": "module"`. ([Sequelize CLI ESM issue](https://github.com/sequelize/cli/issues/1156))

